    "name": "Crafting Service",
    "description": "Tests for Crafting Service (In Kahoots with the Undead, Team 3), run through the Gateway against the real Resource, Player, Exam and World Service of the team docker-compose.yml. Run the folders in order: Setup makes sure the five contract recipes exist, registers a fresh player and grants it resources through Resource Service's refund route. Rollback uses a player id Player Service does not know, so the delivery fails and the ingredients are refunded.",
